    "methods_description": "EEG was recorded using a 64-channel BioSemi system while participants read and rated 210 short texts (70 Haiku, 70 Senryu, 70 Control) on five dimensions: Aesthetic Appeal, Vivid Imagery, Being Moved, Originality, and Creativity, using a 7-point scale. Resting-state EEG was recorded before and after the experiment. Data for four participants with interrupted recording sessions were concatenated during preprocessing using MATLAB scripts and BIDS-compliant tools.",
